ManiSkill PushT-v1 benchmark attribution
========================================

AVBD's ManiSkillPushTTask.swift adapts the state task contract implemented by
ManiSkill's mani_skill/envs/tasks/tabletop/push_t.py. The source is licensed
under Apache-2.0; the adjacent LICENSE is an unmodified copy of the upstream
license.

